WEBVTT

00:00:58.375 --> 00:01:00.333
in the segregated South.

00:01:01.375 --> 00:01:03.143
As a five-year-old girl,

00:01:03.167 --> 00:01:06.351
I was very interested in ballet.

00:01:06.375 --> 00:01:11.000
It seemed to be the five-year-old-girl
thing to do in the 1960s.

00:01:11.833 --> 00:01:15.000
My mother took me to a ballet school.

00:01:15.583 --> 00:01:17.809
You know, the kind of school
that had teachers

00:01:17.833 --> 00:01:19.768
that talked about your gifts and talents

00:01:19.792 --> 00:01:22.018
knowing that you'd never be a ballerina.

00:01:22.042 --> 00:01:24.184
(Laughter)

00:01:24.208 --> 00:01:25.559
When we arrived,

00:01:25.583 --> 00:01:30.417
they said nicely that they
"did not accept Negroes."